{"articleNo":"508283","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=508283&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2025년 서울희망대학진로 장학금 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2025.03.10","hit":"8795","attachments":[{"name":"2025년 서울희망대학진로 장학금.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=508283&attachNo=141711"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">▣ 서울장학재단에서 2025년 서울희망대학진로장학생을 다음과 같이 모집하오니, 해당 학생들의 많은 신청 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.7pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.7pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.7pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장학금명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.7pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.7pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">서울희망대학진로 장학금</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 800</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">진로개발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학년 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 400</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">만원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">회 분할지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">지원성격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학업장려금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">생활비성 장학금으로 등록금 지원성 장학금과 중복 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">서울장학재단 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(www.hissf.or.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">온라인 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학생 개별신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2025.3.19.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 10:00 ~ 3.26.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) 16:00 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 18.7pt; text-indent: -18.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: (1) ~ (4) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">항목을 모두 충족해야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"></p><table style=\"border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:431.25pt;height:172.50pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.28pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.28pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(1) </