style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 정규학기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">학년 이상 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">소득 기준이 아래 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">중 하나에 해당하는 자 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 기초생활수급자 또는 법정차상위계층</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">공고일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(3.7) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">이후 발급 서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 130%; margin-left: 16.2pt; text-indent: -16.2pt;\